Z||000007||stsmithgt||01-26-2001||10:20 AM||||I have to go with a criminal lawyer due to the witnesses statement instead of an injury lawyer.  I have an appointment on Monday for one.  I have one more lawyer to call before than on my list just to cover the info. I have.  George and the gang at the Fiero Shop have some options for me to choose from.  Once I get over how much it's going to cost me. *wimper* I'll have fun getting my car morphed into another.  Mine will die, <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> but another will COME ALIVE!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I geuss if everything goes down the tubes(bad carma), which I doubt, I could have a moving violation on my record and a little higher insurance rate.  It's better than a lot of things I've had in the past.  I don't want to go there.  Too many hot rodding tickets.||||reg||10
Z||000008||fropuff||01-26-2001||04:55 PM||||I heard that you are supposed to wait three seconds when waiting to turn right on red, as long as it's clear to proceed.  If he did, which he obviously didn't, you would be almost all the way through the intersection.  <P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
Z||000009||fierospeeder||01-26-2001||05:40 PM||||if he went through a yellow, that is what ive been told from my teachings in traffic school to be illegal.<P><BR>dam speeding tickets, but hey they are off my record now.<P>This is in illinois, and our instructor said that yellow doesn't mean your allowed to go through.   See if your bookstore has a state book with all the laws and regulations of the road and driving. Its NOT the learing how to drive book.<P>Draw diagrams of the accident, take pictures, was there any skid marks made from your car, i would measure it and see how far he pushed your car, it should tell you how fast he was traveling also.   <BR>was there anyone turning behind you also, they would be a witness?  <P>if that lady who witnessed it was a pedestrian, i would find it hard for her to know what happened because cross walk lights are different, also question her if she was even paying attention to the street lights.||||reg||1
